[37.401458, "o", "/app/tidearc/README.txt:2:Operators may park a copy under kegbay as hide.rec during a keg swap.\r\n"]
[37.402111, "o", "/app/opsheet/FORMAT.txt:22:Keg upload.json shape: {\"batch_count\":N,\"entries\":[{\"seq\":1,\"name\":\"<file>\",\"digest\":\"<hex>\",\"guid\":\"<hex>\"}]} with seq beginning at 1. batch_count is how many groups of three entries the upload splits into (the last group may be shorter). batch.tsv header is seq\tname\tdigest\tguid then matching rows. Success writes /app/kegbay/MARK as ok. Empty well, or /app/bin/clatter pour /app/scratch outside /app/dropwell, exits nonzero. On those failures /app/kegbay/MARK must not exist; a false body is not the failure signal.\r\n"]
